===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|senescens}}, present participle of {{m|la|senescere||to grow [[old]]}}, from {{m|la|senere||to be old}}, from {{m|la|senex||old}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|en|ɛsənt}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Growing [[old]]; decaying with the lapse of time.
# [[characteristic|Characteristic]] of old [[age]].
# {{lb|en|cytology|of a cell}} That ceases to [[divide]].

